WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.634
-Finally, before we go, I'd like
to take a moment

00:00:02.634 --> 00:00:04.033
to thank some of our sponsors
for tonight's show.

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:05.701
They don't always fit in the
commercial breaks and we want to

00:00:05.701 --> 00:00:06.901
make sure we mention
all of them.

00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:08.934
So it's time for
"Tonight Show Sponsors."

00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:10.234
Here we go.

00:00:10.234 --> 00:00:12.467
-♪ Tonight Show sponsors ♪

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:17.300
♪ Tonight Show sponsors ♪

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.601
-PetSmart.

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:20.801
Do you have a ponytail
and wear cargo shorts?

00:00:20.801 --> 00:00:22.667
If so, the lizards are that way.

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:26.501
[ Applause ]

00:00:26.501 --> 00:00:27.667
DraftKings.

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:29.601
Come on, your kids don't need to
go to college.

00:00:29.601 --> 00:00:33.033
[ Applause ]

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.901
Adobe.
Hey. Hey. Hey you.

00:00:35.901 --> 00:00:38.501
Hey. Hey. Hi. Hey you.

00:00:38.501 --> 00:00:41.400
Hey, it's time for
another update.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:45.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:47.067
Vizio TVs.

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:48.601
Are we a good brand? Who knows?

00:00:48.601 --> 00:00:49.901
But look! Big!

00:00:49.901 --> 00:00:52.634
[ Applause ]

00:00:52.634 --> 00:00:54.868
Oreo Thins --
Just like regular Oreos,

00:00:54.868 --> 00:00:56.300
but you're allowed to eat
30 of them.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:00.534
[ Applause ]

00:01:00.534 --> 00:01:02.033
Fruity Pebbles.

00:01:02.033 --> 00:01:04.734
Look, kids, it's based on your
favorite cartoon from the '50s.

00:01:04.734 --> 00:01:08.534
[ Applause ]

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:11.901
Sharpie -- In your hand for a
moment, on your hand forever.

00:01:11.901 --> 00:01:14.734
[ Applause ]

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:16.167
Pringles.

00:01:16.167 --> 00:01:19.000
Come for the chips, stay because
your arm is stuck in the tube.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.033
[ Applause ]

00:01:22.033 --> 00:01:25.100
And finally, Marshalls,
somehow flying under the radar

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.467
while T.J. Maxx takes
all the heat.

00:01:27.467 --> 00:01:29.467
That's it for
"Tonight Show Sponsors."

